    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1353">

                <pb facs="1065" n="949" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg949"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 412.11/41.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-11-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 25, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The period for filing American claims will be extended until December 31st. I
                    shall immediately send an advisory circular letter to all claimants of record
                    here. Claims will be presented through the Foreign Office and I shall at once
                    file those here which were barred on account of late arrival.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
